<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 371 0 R
/E (Created a compelling infographic to communicate the urgent need for sustainable urban planning through the "Forest City" concept. Analyzed multi-source datasets on urban population growth, forest cover decline, and deforestation trends to emphasize the ecological impact of rapid urbanization. Translated complex environmental metrics into intuitive visuals, connecting them with actionable urban solutions. Effectively integrated narrative elements and infographics to demonstrate how green infrastructure, community engagement, and biodiversity conservation can support climate goals and Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\).)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
